            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>New pages</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">API/RTCIdentityAssertion/idp</code> — <code class=\"notranslate\">idp</code> property</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">API/RTCIdentityAssertion/name</code> — <code class=\"notranslate\">name</code> property</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">API/RTCPeerConnection/idpLoginUrl</code> — <code class=\"notranslate\">idpLoginUrl</code> property</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Updated pages</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">API/RTCPeerConnection</code> — Added <code class=\"notranslate\">idpLoginUrl</code> to the list of instance properties</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">API/RTCIdentityAssertion</code> — Fixed <code class=\"notranslate\">name</code> property description, added examples and See also section</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Document properties supported only in Firefox.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>BCD: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/main/api/RTCIdentityAssertion.json\">RTCIdentityAssertion.idp</a></li>\n<li>BCD: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/main/api/RTCIdentityAssertion.json\">RTCIdentityAssertion.name</a></li>\n<li>BCD: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/main/api/RTCPeerConnection.json\">RTCPeerConnection.idpLoginUrl</a></li>\n</ul>",
