        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF150 adds <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLImageElement.sizes</code> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">auto</code> and the corresponding attribute on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/img#sizes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;img&gt;</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1819581\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1819581</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127818135\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43562\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43562/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43562\">#43562</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43728",
            "title": "FF150 Relnote: img sizes attribute supports auto option",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-10T07:28:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-10T07:26:13.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2737650?u=24f8ae447a4efe200de56690b9032b7024ffe01e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mention the default <code class=\"notranslate\">Reflect.get()</code> behavior when the optional <code class=\"notranslate\">receiver</code> parameter is not provided.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I was looking for this information but couldn't find it on MDN.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/reflection.html#sec-reflect.get\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/reflection.html#sec-reflect.get</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43721",
            "title": "Mention default receiver behavior for Reflect.get()",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-09T13:35:22.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-09T12:01:52.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jespertheend",
