            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 146 adds support for <code class=\"notranslate\">AudioPlaybackStats</code>, also known as the Playback statistics API for Web Audio: see <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5172818344148992\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5172818344148992</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds documentation for the <code class=\"notranslate\">AudioPlaybackStats</code> interface and the <code class=\"notranslate\">AudioContext.playbackStats</code> property.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43719",
            "title": "Document AudioPlaybackStats",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-10T17:31:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-09T09:15:25.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185639391?u=751c71478b6941fb552bb737eb44052decdd96e2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Improves the accessibility of the custom form control example in Example 4.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the HTML and JavaScript so the custom control has clearer combobox/listbox semantics, better keyboard handling, and avoids click propagation and blur issues when selecting options.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #31250.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2054727071\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/31250\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/31250/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/31250\">#31250</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43718",
            "title": "fix(forms): improve accessibility of custom form control JS example",
