        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141215061?u=a9271c92151c7a29629057e254a5699c551496b5&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added a deprecation note for historical and compatibility purposes.</li>\n<li>Consolidated Firefox for Fire TV, Echo Show, and Firefox OS (including their device-specific subsections) under the Legacy Firefox Platforms section for clarity and consistency.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43642.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4188868484\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43642\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43642/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43642\">#43642</a></p>",
